: "0", "text": "", "id": 0, "image": "engenn11le15ob03re2img05.jpg"}, {"time": "100", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: \t\tIt looks like we are almost set up. The tables are all ready. We've got an alternate entrance so that we don't clog up the main entrance. We've got lots of copies of the book to sell to the guests.\nI'll stand outside for a bit to make sure people can find the entrance.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: \t\tI'll take care of the consent forms. Just let me know who to give one to.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: Oh, thanks! I had forgotten all about the consent form. Can I see it?\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: Yes. I had to research in order that I would know what the requirements of a consent form are and then I designed this one for us. I'll use it for getting permission to use photos.", "id": 1, "image": "engenn11le15ob03re2img05.jpg"}, {"time": "31000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: It looks great. Thanks, Adam. ... Oh no! This isn't good.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: What's wrong?\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: I just got a text from the speaker I had lined up to talk about social media. She's sick! What am I going to do? I need someone to present so that we fill up some time and people don't get bored.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: What about Denise? You will know that she enjoys that sort of thing.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: Good idea. Can you send her a text? She'll be on her way to the bookstore now.", "id": 2, "image": "engenn11le15ob03re2img06.jpg"}, {"time": "56200", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: Okay. Also, I have a friend who works in social media. He could come and speak about the genres of social media and how they pertain to kids and then Denise could introduce the author and the book. You'll remember my friend Thomas. You met him at my birthday party.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: Oh Adam, that would be great. I do remember him. He's very engaging. He would be great. Can you get him to come over here now so that we can go over what he's going to say?\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: Sure. I'll text him now.", "id": 3, "image": "engenn11le15ob03re2img07.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn11le15ob03re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn11le15ob03re2img05.jpg"}}], "id": 1, "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": []}], "id": 0}]}